<title>USA: Tech Data names Ibarguen president.</title>
<headline>Tech Data names Ibarguen president.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Florida 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tech Data Corp said Wednesday it had named Anthony Ibarguen president and chief operating officer of the company.  </p>
<p>Ibarguen was in charge of the Americas division, which covered Canada, the United States and Latin America.</p>
<p>Tech Data distributes personal computer products like software and peripherals.</p>
